WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.411
Comfort calibration.

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:17.000
Before practice, position the learning volume comfortably with the available system controls, confirm that the floor and nearby space are clear, and use a seated or standing presentation only where the activity allows it.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.431
These are learner comfort checks rather than stored calibration measurements.

00:00:22.431 --> 00:00:26.099
Stop the immersive session whenever comfort changes.
